# Firebase Deploy Proxy (Hawk)

When deploying FocusSpace / Luna / Rosemary under `daisy-c2db8`:

1. Use local seeds under `Desktop\_hawk_repo_seeds\...`, never bare `firebase deploy`.
2. Only `firebase deploy --only hosting:<target>` (`focusspace` / `luna` / `rosemary`).
3. Before any `firebase` / Node network call, set (v2rayN must be running):

```powershell
$env:HTTP_PROXY='http://127.0.0.1:10808'
$env:HTTPS_PROXY='http://127.0.0.1:10808'
$env:NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY='1'
```

Root cause locked 2026-08: Firebase CLI ignores WinINET system proxy; direct TLS to `auth.firebase.tools` resets. Do not `firebase logout` while debugging auth unless asked.

After deploy, spot-check FocusSpace + Rosemary + Luna Live URLs.
